  "evidence": [
    "Pinned515EF0..515F70 snapshots slot0 patrol mask and walks eight MapWin pointer cells. Current int* alias loses pointer-element semantics; preserve per-iteration live table reads, active/first-slot gate and snapshot mask.",
    "Pinned4E10C0 clears low two bits in each Map record +8 with 44-byte stride and signed count. Existing Map::bit and sizeof(Map)=44 supply the genuine member; retain captured tile base and all surrounding call/state ordering.",
    "Pinned5159CB stores selected value at Popup local +A44 after time_controls_dialog and before exec. Existing BasePop value_/set_value(int) and int time_controls_selection_ supply exact member semantics; do not normalize negative/high-bit values.",
    "Pinned510155 and current Sprite member facts identify sprite_a+18 and sprite_b+1C. Use width()/height() respectively, deliberately retaining counterintuitive track_height/track_width interpretation, clamps, sentinel states and redraw order.",
    "Fresh native Console baseline at357a43517 includes200 mapped verdicts in ignored build/recovery/console-typed-owner-before-oct10.json. This scope changes genuine member/address typing, not original function count or acceptance. Preserve claims/history and validate full compile/link plus behavioral controls."
  ],
  "intent": "Recover typed window-table iteration, terrain member updates, popup value and splitter sprite geometry through their existing owners",
